<title>GERMANY: Vereins- und Westbank Q1 oper profit up.</title>
<headline>Vereins- und Westbank Q1 oper profit up.</headline>
<dateline>LUEBECK, Germany 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Germany's Vereins- und Westbank AG, a unit of Bayerische Vereinsbank AG, on Thursday said its operating profit before risk provisions had risen by about one percent in the first quarter of 1997.</p>
<p>Operating profits had risen 20 percent versus three-twelfths of 1997 figures, the bank's management board chairman Udo Bandow told the group's shareholder meeting.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
